    <entry>
      <title>update vs fixed update</title>
      <link href="/2025/12/26/update-vs-fixed-update/"/>
      <url>/2025/12/26/update-vs-fixed-update/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>在 Defold（和大多數遊戲引擎）中，<br><code>update()</code> 與 <code>fixed_update()</code> <strong>適合執行不同的功能</strong>。<br>如果把物理寫在錯的地方，<br>角色的重力與跳躍會受到 FPS 影響，<br>導致物理行為在不同裝置上不一致。</p><p>這篇文章用一個簡單的範例，<br></p><p>說明：</p><ul><li>兩者的差異</li><li>為什麼「物理一定要放在 <code>fixed_update()</code>」</li><li>正確的寫法</li></ul><hr><h2 id="update-dt-是什麼？"><a href="#update-dt-是什麼？" class="headerlink" title="update(dt) 是什麼？"></a>update(dt) 是什麼？</h2><figure class="highlight lua"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="function"><span class="keyword">function</span> <span class="title">update</span><span class="params">(self, dt)</span></span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">-- 每一幀執行一次</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">end</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="特性"><a href="#特性" class="headerlink" title="特性"></a>特性</h3><ul><li>每一畫面幀執行一次</li><li><code>dt</code> 不固定</li><li>受 FPS 影響</li></ul><h3 id="適合放什麼？"><a href="#適合放什麼？" class="headerlink" title="適合放什麼？"></a>適合放什麼？</h3><ul><li>輸入</li><li>動畫</li><li>UI &#x2F; 相機</li></ul><hr><h2 id="fixed-update-dt-是什麼？"><a href="#fixed-update-dt-是什麼？" class="headerlink" title="fixed_update(dt) 是什麼？"></a>fixed_update(dt) 是什麼？</h2><figure class="highlight lua"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="function"><span class="keyword">function</span> <span class="title">fixed_update</span><span class="params">(self, dt)</span></span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">-- 固定時間步長執行</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">end</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="特性-1"><a href="#特性-1" class="headerlink" title="特性"></a>特性</h3><ul><li>固定時間步長</li><li>與 FPS 無關</li><li>物理穩定</li></ul><h3 id="適合放什麼？-1"><a href="#適合放什麼？-1" class="headerlink" title="適合放什麼？"></a>適合放什麼？</h3><ul><li>重力</li><li>速度 &#x2F; 加速度</li><li>碰撞</li></ul><hr><h2 id="錯誤"><a href="#錯誤" class="headerlink" title="錯誤"></a>錯誤</h2><figure class="highlight lua"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="function"><span class="keyword">function</span> <span class="title">update</span><span class="params">(self, dt)</span></span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">self</span>.velocity.y = <span class="built_in">self</span>.velocity.y + <span class="built_in">self</span>.gravity * dt</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">self</span>.pos.y = <span class="built_in">self</span>.pos.y + <span class="built_in">self</span>.velocity.y * dt</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">end</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="正確"><a href="#正確" class="headerlink" title="正確"></a>正確</h2><h3 id="update"><a href="#update" class="headerlink" title="update()"></a>update()</h3><figure class="highlight lua"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="function"><span class="keyword">function</span> <span class="title">update</span><span class="params">(self, dt)</span></span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">self</span>.<span class="built_in">input</span>:update()</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">self</span>.dir = <span class="built_in">self</span>.<span class="built_in">input</span>.intended <span class="keyword">or</span> <span class="number">0</span></span><br><span class="line">    Anim.act(<span class="built_in">self</span>, <span class="built_in">self</span>.dir)</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">end</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="fixed-update"><a href="#fixed-update" class="headerlink" title="fixed_update()"></a>fixed_update()</h3><figure class="highlight lua"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="function"><span class="keyword">function</span> <span class="title">fixed_update</span><span class="params">(self, dt)</span></span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">self</span>.pos.x = <span class="built_in">self</span>.pos.x + <span class="built_in">self</span>.dir * <span class="built_in">self</span>.speed * dt</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> <span class="keyword">not</span> <span class="built_in">self</span>.on_ground <span class="keyword">then</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">self</span>.velocity.y = <span class="built_in">self</span>.velocity.y + <span class="built_in">self</span>.gravity * dt</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">end</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">self</span>.pos.y = <span class="built_in">self</span>.pos.y + <span class="built_in">self</span>.velocity.y * dt</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> <span class="built_in">self</span>.pos.y &lt;= <span class="number">0</span> <span class="keyword">then</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">self</span>.pos.y = <span class="number">0</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">self</span>.velocity.y = <span class="number">0</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">self</span>.on_ground = <span class="literal">true</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">else</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">self</span>.on_ground = <span class="literal">false</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">end</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    go.set_position(<span class="built_in">self</span>.pos)</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">end</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="結論"><a href="#結論" class="headerlink" title="結論"></a>結論</h2><table><thead><tr><th>方法</th><th>處理內容</th><th>需求</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>update()</code></td><td>輸入、動畫、UI</td><td>即時滑順</td></tr><tr><td><code>fixed_update()</code></td><td>重力、速度、碰撞</td><td>相同結果</td></tr></tbody></table><pre>如果把物理寫在update，低效能的電腦 角色受 重力更新 的 次數就較 低，高效能的電腦 角色受 重力更新 的 次數就較 高，導致相同的平台高度 有的人可以輕鬆跳過去，有的人不可能跳過去。遊戲開發時需要注意這點，才能帶給玩家一致的遊戲體驗。</pre><p>總結 : 簡單來說，只要是與物理行為相關，<br>都應該寫在 <code>fixed_update()</code> 中。</p><hr>]]></content>
      
      
      
